SUMMARY:Jazz & Reflection at Beach United
DESCRIPTION:From soulful jazz to the Great American Songbook\, vocalist Laurel Tubman brings warmth\, energy and beautiful sounds to every song. She will be joined by Jacob Damelin on piano and Jesse Visser on bass for this afternoon concert at Beach United. Come and enjoy great live music and a welcoming community! Free admission; donations welcome.
