SUMMARY:Beaches Presbyterian Church 100th Anniversary Service
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate! We’re 100 years old! Beaches Presbyterian Church will be celebrating 100 years of service in the Beaches community. \nOur building has been a hub of activity in the neighbourhood since 1926. Within these walls have been countless worship services\, concerts\, fundraisers\, pot-luck dinners\, coffee houses\, lunches\, marriages\, funerals\, baptisms and much more. \nIt has truly been a blessing to do Gods work in this community for so long. Please join us at 10 a.m. for our worship service followed by a gathering to chat and enjoy a piece of cake and a coffee or tea. For any further info about BPC\, please visit our website at www.beacheschurch.org
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/beaches-presbyterian-church-100th-anniversary-service/
LOCATION:Beaches Presbyterian Church\, 65 Glen Manor Drive\, Toronto\, M4E 3V3
END:VEVENT
