SUMMARY:Organ Recital & High Tea Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of beautiful organ music from 2-3 p.m.\, followed by a high tea fundraiser from 3-5 p.m. Featuring music by Buxtehude\, Bach\, Widor and Canadian composers Tyler Versluis and Denis Bédard. A goodwill offering will be accepted for the recital. High Tea tickets are $25 per person and will be available at the door. Proceeds will support our Christmas party for families in need. All are welcome! Info: Elizabeth at coffeehour@stnicholasbirchcliff.com
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/organ-recital-high-tea-fundraiser/
LOCATION:St. Nicholas\, Birch Cliff\, 1512 Kingston Rd.\, Toronto
