SUMMARY:Pink Tea to Celebrate Persons Day
DESCRIPTION:Join MPP Mary-Margaret McMahon\, who passed the bill to recognize Persons Day Act 2024 on October 18 each year\, to celebrate the women who changed Canada forever over a cup of tea!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/pink-tea-to-celebrate-persons-day/
